<title>HONG KONG: Pacific Electric unit sets $100 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Pacific Electric unit sets $100 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating rate notes issue due June 2002 was announced by bookrunner Sanwa International Finance Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER    GALLATIN INTERNATIONAL LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR   PACIFIC ELECTRIC WIRE &amp; CABLE CO LTD</p>
<p> AMOUNT	US$100 MLN  COUPON     6ML+70BP MATURITY  5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	  FRN	   ISS PRICE  PAR	LAUNCH    26.MAY.97</p>
<p> PUTS	  NONE	  CALLS	YR 3     REPLIES  *06.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING     --	    REPAYMENT  BULLET   DENOMS    --</p>
<p> RATING	--	    SALE LMTS  STANDARD TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> HOME CTRY   TAIWAN	GOV LAW    ENGLISH  PAY DATE  --</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   CO-ARRANGERS	  US$10 MLN   20BP  ALL-IN  74BP</p>
<p>   CO-LEAD MANAGERS    US$5-9 MLN  15BP  ALL-IN  73BP</p>
<p>   MANAGERS		US$2-4 MLN  10BP  ALL-IN  72BP</p>
<p> ARRANGERS     SANWA INTERNATIONAL FINANCE (BOOKS) AND BANQUE</p>
<p>		   NATIONALE DE PARIS, TAIPEI BRANCH</p>
<p>CO-ARRANGERS  DAIWA SECURITIES (HK) AND SUMITOMO TRUST FINANCE</p>
<p>		   (HK)</p>
<p> NOTES	   *REPLIES ARE EXPECTED BEFORE 5 P.M. HONG KONG</p>
<p>		   TIME (0900 GMT) ON JUNE 6.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
